{"id":"baguette","lemma":"baguette","pos":"noun","rank":4916,"glosses":["stick, rod, any long thin object","baguette, French stick","chopstick"],"ipa":"/ba.ɡɛt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/Fr-baguette.ogg/Fr-baguette.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"baguettes"},"formAudio":{"baguettes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-baguettes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il sait manger avec des baguettes.","en":"He knows how to eat with chopsticks.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"C'est une baguette magique.","en":"This is a magic wand.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"magic, magical"}]},{"text":"J'aimerais avoir une baguette magique.","en":"I wish I had a magic wand.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"magic, magical"}]},{"text":"Je ne sais pas manger avec des baguettes.","en":"I don't know how to use chopsticks.","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[0,4,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Excusez-moi, j'ai laissé tomber mes baguettes.","en":"Excuse me, I dropped my chopsticks.","words":[{"g":"to excuse","l":"excuser"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"to fall"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}